      "content": "taking a day off doesn't change anything though. the cycle just repeats. i look at my hands and i don't even see myself anymore, i just see tools for the company. it feels like i'm already dead, just walking around in a loop. like there's no way to actually reclaim myself from this. everything i do is just feeding a system that hates me. i feel so stuck, like there's no exit from this version of existence.",
